*      FAP                                                              MCEXP000
*MCEXP         FAST EXPONENTIAL FOR MONTE-CARLO TYPE CALCULATIONS.      MCEXP001
       COUNT   250                                                      MCEXP002
       LBL     MCEXP,C                                                  MCEXP003
*                          EXPONENTIAL                                  MCEXP004
*                                                                       MCEXP005
*              CALLING SEQUENCE  TSX  $MCEXP,4                          MCEXP006
*                                                                       MCEXP007
*              IF ARGUMENT IS GREATER THAN 88.028, ROUTINE RETURNS      MCEXP008
*                  MACHINE INFINITY (=1.7E+38).                         MCEXP009
*              IF ARGUMENT IS LESS THAN -88.028, ROUTINE RETURNS 0.     MCEXP010
       ENTRY   MCEXP                                                    MCEXP011
       EVEN                                                             MCEXP012
 MCEXP TMI     T102                                                     MCEXP013
       CAS     =88.028              TEST IF OUT OF RANGE                MCEXP014
       TRA     INF                  IF TOO LARGE,                       MCEXP015
       TRA     INF                  RETURN WITH INFINITY                MCEXP016
 T52   LRS     27                                                       MCEXP017
       SUB     =O242                CONVERT TO FIXED POINT              MCEXP018
       STA     SH1                                                      MCEXP019
       MPY     =1.442695B1          X TIMES LOGE BASE 2                 MCEXP020
 SH1   LRS     **                   SEPARATE INTEGER AND FRACTION       MCEXP021
