       STO     V                    2**I                                MCEXP023
       MPY     =.693147B0           F*LOG2                              MCEXP024
       XCA                                                              MCEXP025
       ZAC                                                              MCEXP026
       LLS     7                                                        MCEXP027
       SXA     EXT5,1                                                   MCEXP028
